-| 표집/선정 | train3000/class/epoch;AdamW1e−4,wd1e−4,batch2×accum4 | max200/min30/patience25,min_delta1e−4,raw best별도 |
-| 시험 | 무증강873primary,test-only1000/class generatedsecondary | 정답수/분모/raw비율,patientcluster95%CI |
